message: "If you use Zamin, please cite it as below."
title: "Zamin — PRATIK Ternary Silicon: physicalizing the poised-zero substrate"
abstract: >-
  Hardware-realization blueprint for the PRATIK balanced-ternary substrate of the PEDLER
  Event Algebra: MTCMOS three-rail ternary logic with a physical high-impedance poised-zero,
  a complementary dual-memristor 3D crossbar with autogenous dimension spawning, spatial
  linguistic compilation, TSV routing, and microfluidic cooling. Includes a SPICE cell
  library, a gdsfactory layout generator, an IEEE manuscript, and a WYSIWYG circuit simulator.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/zistgah/zamin"
url: "https://zistgah.org/zamin/"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21297556"
authors:
